{% extends "_base.j2" %}
{% block main %}
<span class="eyebrow">Learn</span>
<h1>Walkthroughs</h1>
<p>Narrated paths through real Dwarf workflows. Each step links to a real file or a real <code>/operate</code> page — the dashboard pages and the codebase are the documentation, and these walkthroughs give you a way to traverse them in order.</p>

<p class="page-subhero">For object authoring and curation, start with the <a href="/learn/examples#asset-examples">catalog examples</a>, then follow the matching detail page’s source-of-truth and mutability boundary. Use <a href="/operate/profile-templates">profile templates</a> to create profiles, <a href="/operate/testcases">testcases</a> to triage retained candidates, <a href="/operate/corpora">corpora</a> and <a href="/operate/grammars">generation grammars</a> to curate inputs, and <a href="/learn/plugin-authoring">plugin authoring</a> only for reviewed code extensions.</p>

<hr class="hairline">

{% if empty %}
<p class="empty-section-statement">
  No walkthroughs available.
  <span class="empty-section-statement__cite">walkthrough catalog is empty</span>
</p>
{% else %}
{% for walkthrough in walkthroughs %}
{% include "learn/_partials/_walkthrough.j2" %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
